{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 41, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the breaking dawn, thou shalt rise and make thy way to the land of the rising sun, Japan. Take thy transportation to the airport and board the plane. Soar through the air like an eagle, crossing oceans and continents, until thou arrive in the land of sushi and samurai.\n\n\nUpon arrival, make thy way to thy lodgings and rest thy weary head. Tomorrow, a new adventure begins.\n\n\nOn the morrow, journey to the city of Tokyo, the bustling metropolis filled with neon lights and ancient traditions. Visit the Meiji Shrine, a peaceful oasis in the midst of the city, and pay thy respects to the deities enshrined within.\n\n\nThen, make thy way to the Asakusa district and explore the Senso-ji Temple, the oldest temple in Tokyo. Gaze upon the giant lantern at the entrance and wander the Nakamise shopping street, where vendors sell traditional snacks and souvenirs.\n\n\nIn the afternoon, visit the Shibuya Crossing, the busiest intersection in the world. Marvel at the sea of people crossing in all directions and take a photo of the famous Hachiko statue, the loyal dog who waited for his master at the station every day.\n\n\nOn the third day, travel to the ancient city of Kyoto, the former imperial capital of Japan. Visit the Kinkaku-ji Temple, the Golden Pavilion, and gaze upon its reflection in the mirror pond. Then, make thy way to the Fushimi Inari Shrine and walk through the thousands of vermilion torii gates that line the mountain paths.\n\n\nOn the final day of thy journey, visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park and pay thy respects to those who lost their lives in the atomic bombing. Reflect upon the importance of peace and the horrors of war.\n\n\nIn the evening, return to Tokyo and prepare for thy departure. Thou wilt leave Japan with a heart full of memories and a mind filled with new knowledge. Fare thee well, Japan, and may we meet again.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.012731345370411873}, {"token": "breaking", "logprob": -3.4308786392211914}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.4289725422859192}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00048232366680167615}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.024148032069206238}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0028300732374191284}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "rise", "logprob": -3.308314800262451}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.2633041739463806}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.1514165848493576}, {"token": "way", "logprob": -0.0010969580616801977}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.00020704510097857565}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0006526962388306856}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -0.5587325692176819}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -5.960446742392378e-06}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.027775874361395836}, {"token": "rising", "logprob": -0.005977965891361237}, {"token": "sun", "logprob": -1.3232143828645349e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0009704885887913406}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.0015863704029470682}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0003281293320469558}, {"token": "Take", "logprob": -0.5067571401596069}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.3355189561843872}, {"token": "transportation", "logprob": -0.7136893272399902}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.1022554337978363}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -3.814689989667386e-06}, {"token": "airport", "logprob": -0.038440123200416565}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.06199965998530388}, {"token": "board", "logprob": -0.006949657574295998}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.843940019607544}, {"token": "plane", "logprob": -0.3355307877063751}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.3147116899490356}, {"token": "So", "logprob": -1.7030497789382935}, {"token": "ar", "logprob": -0.005840498022735119}, {"token": "through", "logprob": -0.0015733970794826746}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -3.5762781180892